{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fA3xWSZDHB1793069884.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>接受肺癌手術的教宗良十四世恢復情況理想，將如期下月出訪南美。</p><p></p><p>梵蒂岡周一引述醫療團隊指出，近期檢查證實良十四世術後恢復及健康狀況良好，可按原訂計劃下月6日至17日出訪烏拉圭、阿根廷及秘魯。此訪行程約31,000公里，將到訪10個城市，並發表36場演講。梵蒂岡聲明表示，良十四世正與醫生協調日常行程，優先考慮康復，同時繼續履職。</p><p></p><p>現年71歲的良十四世，先前被診斷出罹患肺腺癌，並於本月13日進行右下肺葉切除手術。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:41.421439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:12.583161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:30.739817+00:00","content_hash":"0c3e5d5808dcff9122c765cc40372215cb2548efb5152f3af75f7aa9ccde34a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:41.421439+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}